			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Simplify binary name and Tauri identifier to production values\n\nReplace the verbose development profile identifier `DevelopmentNodeEnvironment_MicrosoftVSCodeDependency_24NodeVersion_Bundle_Clean_Debug_ElectronProfile_EsbuildCompiler_Mountain` with the canonical `Mountain` name across Cargo.toml (binary, library, default-run, package name) and tauri.conf.json (productName, identifier).\n\nUpdate the Tauri identifier from `land.editor.binary.development.node.environment.microsoft.vscode.dependency.node.24.bundle.clean.debug.electron.profile.esbuild.compiler.mountain` to `fiddee.editor.binary` to align with the FIDDEE product branding. Reorganize resource mappings in tauri.conf.json for logical grouping, inline externalBin and targets arrays, and remove deprecated backup files.\n\nImpact: Clean production-ready naming for the Mountain native backend binary and Tauri application identity.",
